{"id":"b039951a7138aeff","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-schnorrtest.md","title":"Schnorr 检验","display":"df-schnorrtest — Schnorr 检验","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-schnorrtest","aliases":["43-df-schnorrtest"],"display":"df-schnorrtest — Schnorr 检验","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]","[[43-df-mltest]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.1、Lemma 10.2.2，印刷213–214，PDF233–234；§16.2相对化，印刷489，PDF509","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-schnorrtest"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-schnorrtest</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-schnorrtest — Schnorr 检验"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§10.2 Definition 10.2.1、Lemma 10.2.2，印刷213–214，PDF233–234；§16.2相对化，印刷489，PDF509"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(U\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}^{B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}^{B}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q\">\\(q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q\\)</span> 在全域总定义，有理输出按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a> 编码。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{MLTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(V)\\land\\exists q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(q)\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(n,k)-\\mu(V_n)|\\le2^{-k}\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\left(U=V\\land\\mathrm{MLTest}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(V)\\land\\exists q:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Computable}^{\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)}(q)\\land\\forall n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\;|q(n,k)-\\mu(V_n)|\\le2^{-k}\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(U)\\iff\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{\\varnothing}(U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(U)\\iff\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^{\\varnothing}(U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一个预言机控制开集的统一枚举与测度的统一双侧近似。q 的函数类型保证总性；Borel 见证 V 保证测度调用在其定义域内。所用“测度统一可计算且不超过 2^{-n}”形式保留原附件的定义。</p>\n<p>书目定位沿用附件的 §10.2 Definition 10.2.1、Lemma 10.2.2，以及 §16.2 的相对化；本轮核查类型与内部一致性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h